public enum Direction {
    UP(-1, 0), DOWN(1, 0), LEFT(0, -1), RIGHT(0, 1);

    private final int deltaRow;
    private final int deltaCol;
}

The body holds, front to back, (3,4) (3,3) (3,2) - head at column 4. The player moves RIGHT, and there is no food at the new position. List the body afterwards.,"(3,5) (3,4) (3,3) (3,2) - four segments","(3,5) (3,4) (3,3) - still three segments, every coordinate shifted one column right","(3,3) (3,2) (3,1) - the snake moved backwards","(3,4) (3,3) (3,2) - unchanged, since no food was eaten",,2,"RIGHT adds 1 to the column, so the new head is (3,5). It goes on the front, and because nothing was eaten the old tail (3,2) is dropped - the length is unchanged and the snake has slid forward.",2

