Following on: with occupied missing a cell the snake really occupies, what could go wrong later?,Nothing - occupied is only used for reporting,"Two things: a later move onto that cell would not be detected as a collision, and spawnFood() could place food directly on top of the snake, since both rely on occupied being complete",The snake would be drawn one segment short,The score would be one point too low,,2,The Set is the single source of truth for both the collision check and food placement. Any drift between it and the Deque corrupts both.,2

